[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17642.39, "timestamp": "04:54:02", "text": "那是只猫之类的东西。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17645.51, "timestamp": "04:54:05", "text": "毛茸茸的狐狸之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17649.19, "timestamp": "04:54:09", "text": "我用过一段时间。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17652.03, "timestamp": "04:54:12", "text": "我就是这样进入这个行业的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17655.35, "timestamp": "04:54:15", "text": "YouTube。对我来说，我喜欢什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17658.23, "timestamp": "04:54:18", "text": "他们成功做到了。所以当我看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17661.19, "timestamp": "04:54:21", "text": "那个Hutsin Miku的东西，我当时就喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17664.31, "timestamp": "04:54:24", "text": "即使是3D的，也能做到这一点，真是太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17667.67, "timestamp": "04:54:27", "text": "二维形式虽然存在局限性，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17669.708, "timestamp": "04:54:29", "text": "即使有所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17672.47, "timestamp": "04:54:32", "text": "限制，他们能够创造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17674.868, "timestamp": "04:54:34", "text": "从中发现一些独特的东西。任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17677.91, "timestamp": "04:54:37", "text": "他们拥有以及任何技术"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17679.67, "timestamp": "04:54:39", "text": "进展"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17682.47, "timestamp": "04:54:42", "text": "呃，这是因为他们能够适应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17684.55, "timestamp": "04:54:44", "text": "快速创造新事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17687.27, "timestamp": "04:54:47", "text": "不管它是不是，就像……呃，当它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17689.67, "timestamp": "04:54:49", "text": "来到 IRL 和其他创作者那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17691.91, "timestamp": "04:54:51", "text": "他们可以轻松自由表达的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17695.43, "timestamp": "04:54:55", "text": "他们自己，因为这一切都是为了他们所有人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17697.75, "timestamp": "04:54:57", "text": "身体在镜头前清晰可见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17699.83, "timestamp": "04:54:59", "text": "以及他们的表达方式。"}]